{"name": "Tyto", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The owls of Hoot Haven just wanted a peaceful life... and then The Vultures came.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"92\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/4340c75307a155388c5f624143de09a2.avif?t=1791584517\" width=\"1031\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"244\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/32e4b4ad9ff4892966f346a336e4cad3.poster.avif?t=1791584517\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/32e4b4ad9ff4892966f346a336e4cad3.webm?t=1791584517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/32e4b4ad9ff4892966f346a336e4cad3.mp4?t=1791584517\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tyto is a gliding-based metroidvania where traversal, platforming and combat are all based around gliding and flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Glide through the treetops, uncover hidden secrets, fight to free the forest from The Vultures' tyranny and reunite with your family.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"92\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/57808c838801116bad16c8d9b4cb88e6.avif?t=1791584517\" width=\"1031\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"244\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/76be4c49ed1a257e4b00899af3481dc5.poster.avif?t=1791584517\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/76be4c49ed1a257e4b00899af3481dc5.webm?t=1791584517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/76be4c49ed1a257e4b00899af3481dc5.mp4?t=1791584517\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as <strong>Yali</strong>, a young owlet lost in a vast forest ruled by fearsome vultures. Rescued by mice, he becomes part of their rebellion, bringing a unique advantage - the power of flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore new areas, discover secrets, overcome enemies and fly through challenging paths to become more powerful, unlock new abilities and defeat challenging bosses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"92\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/0a74c8bcd543c8056236949c18976776.avif?t=1791584517\" width=\"1031\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"244\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/2b1345444a03b630ab721d33a6e4aa00.poster.avif?t=1791584517\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/2b1345444a03b630ab721d33a6e4aa00.webm?t=1791584517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/extras/2b1345444a03b630ab721d33a6e4aa00.mp4?t=1791584517\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every little piece in Tyto is meticulously placed by hand to create a vivid, lively, beautiful environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is brought to life with a reactive environment that responds to the player's every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every new area is different, from the owls' cozy village, to the mice's underground town, the mysterious Wind Temple and the wilderness of The Outside.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Take flight and glide through a breathtaking world in Tyto, a gliding-based metroidvania, where you play as a lost owlet searching for its family in a vast and perilous world.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3579340/77d4e69fecb48c0984cba6a789cab9d2513d4516/header.jpg?t=1791584517", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Metroidvania", "Atmospheric", "Flight", "Birds", "Exploration", "2D Platformer"], "developers": "Dreamjob Games", "publishers": "Dreamjob Games", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3579340", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "9 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/2B5yLxE3vgA", "first_seen": 1791496800.0, "review_rank": 0}